{"v":4,"catch":"跑步去吃飯！\n官方熊本迷你遊戲現已在Nintendo Switch™上發售!","desc":"“Kumamon Run”是一款遊戲，在遊戲中，Kumamon一邊跑步，一邊從熊本縣收集美味的特產，如草莓和西瓜。\n玩家在參觀熊本的著名景點時，控制上下路徑，幫助熊本盡可能長時間地奔跑。\n如果你沒能收集到特產，熊本的耐力就會逐漸下降。 當螢幕頂部的耐力計用完時，遊戲結束了！\n現在，你能和熊本一起跑多遠？","publisher":"Edia","release":"2023-12-21","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/555c5437b1adc90b65336cdd1962b355e632b72e3752c017123cacc24c2c71f8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fedf3875b417ff5fdf14bbd8d93a201d1835dd61a14375af94bf8250e0032756.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e5ff04113f582262f527d251ee292b197b13bdd52d6709ceaa977949561efbe2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/54bed37604cd59755267e9f67a41c7e39926b1c2552474a7aaac8a195498afb5.jpg"],"titleId":"0100d3a01d854000","dlc":[]}